{"author":{"id":"53b38b4189542570b1a723cdea9ea54af99104fbc59b44537f04a0e63f4629c5"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795290095,"nonce":"r149LLs85JItifoUsovn3xLIWE4=","title":"L1 — Upgrade and pin all dependencies, pnpm 12 workspace","message":"## Context\nDeps use `^` ranges and are far behind (astro 5.15.1 → 7.x, @astrojs/vercel 9 → 11, tailwind 4.1 → 4.3, sharp 0.34 → 0.35). `pnpm install` exits 1 under pnpm 12: `pnpm-workspace.yaml:1` uses `onlyBuiltDependencies`, pnpm 12 wants `allowBuilds`. Mirror `../starting-for-here` toolchain setup.\n\n## Files\n- `package.json` — exact versions, no `^`/`~`; add `packageManager`, `engines` (copy shape from `../starting-for-here/package.json`)\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml` — replace `onlyBuiltDependencies` with `allowBuilds` (esbuild, sharp true; follow `../starting-for-here/pnpm-workspace.yaml`)\n- `.npmrc` — new, `engine-strict=true`\n- `.nvmrc` — new, `24`\n- `.gitignore` — add `.vercel/` (adapter writes `.vercel/output` on build)\n- `astro.config.mjs` — only if astro 7 / adapter 11 needs changes\n- `src/**` — only astro-7 breakage fixes (`ClientRouter` in `src/layouts/BaseLayout.astro:2`, `Code` in `src/components/FAQ.astro:2`, `astro:assets` Image)\n\n## Approach\n- `pnpm outdated`, then `pnpm add -E \u003cpkg\u003e@latest` (dev deps `-D -E`) for every dep\n- Read astro 6 and 7 upgrade guides (context7) and fix what `pnpm build` reports\n- Keep versions aligned with starting-for-here where both use a package\n\n## Out of scope\n- eslint/prettier/check tooling (L2)\n- Visual changes\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Fresh `pnpm install` exits 0 under pnpm 12, no ignored-builds error\n- No `^` or `~` in `package.json` dependencies or devDependencies\n- `pnpm build` passes and all 4 pages build\n- `pnpm dev` serves `/` and `/installation` without console errors","files":null}]}